   "title": "»zidCode«",
   "text": "<p>More safety and efficiency <br/>through simple tool data handling</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/shop/zidcode\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Buy now</a></p>",
