  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> We stand for smart progress </h2>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER's automated data handling makes processes simpler and safer. As soon as you have identified a tool by scanning, the associated tool data is transferred error-free - right up to the CNC machine control - so that top-class components can be produced.</p> <p>Choose your smart ZOLLER solution for perfect tool data handling: »zidCode« or »zidCode 4.0«.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ru/products/tool-management/data-transfer/zidcode/zidcode\">»zidCode«</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ru/products/tool-management/data-transfer/zidcode/zidcode-40\">»zidCode 4.0«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/9/csm_zidcode_intro_2d62127d21.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1000,
     "h": 1000
    }
   ],
