  {
   "type": "quotes",
   "header": "",
   "slides": [
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/7/csm_zidCode_slider_1af9b576c4.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>»zidCode«</h2> <p class=\"large-text\"><strong>For production without your own network. The fast entry into the digital and error-free transfer of tool data.</strong></p> <p class=\"large-text\">With »zidCode«, you quickly have decisive success factors at your disposal. You gain security, time and make it easier for your employees to transfer data to the machine.</p>",
     "right": false,
     "quote": false,
     "dark": false
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/b/csm_zidCode4_slider_e9ce590696.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>»zidCode 4.0«</h2> <p class=\"large-text\"><strong>For production facilities with their own network. Opens up additional options for greater efficiency with your tool data.</strong></p> <p class=\"large-text\">With »zidCode 4.0«, you create the basis for drawing a precise picture of the tool performance in your production using other ZOLLER software tools - even in real time. This increases transparency and process reliability in tool planning.</p>",
     "right": false,
     "quote": false,
     "dark": false
    }
   ],
