  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Efficient tool handling </h2>",
   "body": "<p>With ZOLLER, you can use your tool data consistently from work preparation to the CNC machine. You increase efficiency in tool handling, network sub-processes and increase process reliability with automated data transfer. Digitize your production with the TMS Tool Management Solutions from ZOLLER: interfaces, software, tool identification and data transfer with »zidCode 4.0«.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ru/products/tool-management/data-transfer/zidcode/software-integration\">More about Software &amp; Integration</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/b/csm_schunk_tms_2edc1e99a4.webp",
