  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Services - first-class all along the line </h2>",
   "body": "<p>By purchasing ZOLLER »zidCode« or »zidCode 4.0«, you have made a sustainable investment. With the ZOLLER service and our training offer, we ensure the best possible use of your tool identification. You can rely on our fast response times at all times.</p>",
